From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: office <office@localhost>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 18:00:00 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] gridcraft: zip 9 (RUSTSEC-2026-0545, -0548)

zip 3.0.0 to 9 (owner decision 2026-11-22): the workspace requirement and the call sites of the one API change
we meet (ZipFile::name and ZipArchive::name_for_index now return ZipResult<Cow<str>>). Production: package.rs
skips an entry whose name does not decode (zip 9 never fails on UTF-8 or CP437 names), the CLI check lists only
decodable names. ods.rs matches the entity name on the dereferenced bytes: zip 9 brings typed-path, whose AsRef
impls make the old r.as_ref() ambiguous. Tests: .unwrap(). Cargo.lock is patch 0921.
---
diff --git a/Cargo.toml b/Cargo.toml
index e8a6dc67..8ab4abee 100644
--- a/Cargo.toml
+++ b/Cargo.toml
@@ -33,7 +33,7 @@ log = "0.4"
